      "writtenOn": "2024-06-12T18:25:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With this change, does UI still need to call stopBroadcast?\n\nwould that be handled by this previous CL?\nhttps://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/packages/modules/Bluetooth/+/3088479",
      "revId": "3996a0cfc2ab32b4923824f842138ac630c65a5d",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cda7ea3f_7ebcec9b",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java",
