      "message": "This should be solved with aosp/3088479 (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/le_audio/LeAudioService.java;drc\u003d10095dc53cc8b8a807dc36807fb4238bda3a7aea;l\u003d4334)",
