      "writtenOn": "2024-06-17T17:05:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@yiyishen@google.com in that case, we might not be able to try the e2e scenarios. if you got a chance, could you give a try with your local change? or we can also move forward to merge this first and then you apply your UI change later?",
      "parentUuid": "9d7a6517_4317b2b3",
      "revId": "3996a0cfc2ab32b4923824f842138ac630c65a5d",
